    "title": "Cody Bellinger Announcement: Yankees' Surprising Turnaround",
    "text": "“`html\nNew York Yankees outfielder Cody Bellinger has been named American League Player of the Week, capping off a resurgent stretch that has seen the team win seven of its last eight games.\nBellinger’s performance was a meaningful factor in the Yankees’ recent turnaround, which followed a disappointing start after the All-Star break. After dropping three straight to the Boston Red sox, the team has found its rhythm, with Bellinger at the forefront.\nST LOUIS, MISSOURI – AUGUST 15: Cody Bellinger #35 of the New York Yankees in the dugout prior to the MLB game against the St. Louis Cardinals at Busch Stadium on August 15, 2025 in St Louis, Missouri.\nMore\nVishwanat/Getty\nDuring the week of Aug. 25-31, Bellinger batted",
